    "title": "US Chamber Of Commerce: 'Get Tough' On China",
    "text": "With the trade truce deadline looming, US businesses want Washington to get tough on China, protecting America from Beijing's so-called \"Delete America\" policies.\nThe US-China trade truce is expiring on Nov. 10 and Washington is pushing for a new deal with Beijing before then.\nAt the same time, the American business community is changing its tune, increasingly calling on the Trump administration to take a tougher stance on China.",
